        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9013, Urban Contemporary Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUrban in design, this new chic cabinet door pull has a very sleek look. The wide mounts contrast the thin grip for a unique and modern appearance. It is constructed out of solid brass and is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/urban-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-9013p-415\"><b>Matching Urban Appliance Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Urban Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9013/150:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 6\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9013/238:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 9-3/8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9013/311:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12-1/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
